essly from the previous moment with no scene change, Shot 2 medium close-up from her right side with a slow lateral tracking move drifting left to right. Tiaoye reaches her right hand forward and her fingertips graze the spine of a thick leather book, then soft cool blue particles begin to lift away from the book's edges as her brown eyes widen and her brows pull upward. The warm amber bookstore light remains the dominant key across her face and coat while the book's blue glow forms a small accent only at her fingertips. She exclaims '这本，在发光！就是它了！', her shoulders rising in a quick excited inhale, fingers curling slightly inward, lips parted softly as her gaze locks onto the book and her breath holds for the next moment. audio: a soft crystalline chime sparking once, quiet breath catch, ambient bookstore hush. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment with no scene change, Shot 3 extreme close-up on the leather spellbook cover with a static frame and subtle handheld breathing. A hand presses flat onto the cover as glowing blue runes ignite one by one across the surface, then crystalline light particles spiral up from beneath the fingers while energy ripples outward from the central diamond rune symbol. The cool blue rune light dominates the entire frame as the singular key, casting a soft glow upward onto the unseen palm. A low ancient voice issues from the book narrating '开启，通往，黑暗森林之门', the glow pulses gently in rhythm with each whispered syllable, the fingers tense slightly against the leather as the page seam begins to part for what is about to unfold. audio: low magical hum building slowly, layered crystalline chimes, deep ancient whispering breath, faint paper unfurling. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment with no scene change, Shot 4 medium close-up at a low angle with a gentle slow push-in. Tiaoye now holds the open spellbook in both hands at chest height as she tilts her head upward, then the soft blue glow from the open pages bathes her freckled face from below while tiny shimmering particles rise around her shoulders. The book's blue magical glow dominates the entire scene as the singular key light, with the wooden bookshelves softly blurred and desaturated behind her. She breathes out in quiet wonder '好神奇，黑暗森林，我来救你了！', her chin lifting as her shoulders settle into resolve, lips parting softly into a small determined smile, eyes shining with the reflected blue light. audio: warm magical resonance swelling, soft particle shimmer, quiet breath of wonder, gentle ambient harmonic swell.\",  \"segment_lengths\": \"80,88,96,97\",  \"ltxv_add_guide_multi\": {    \"num_guides\": 4,    \"frame_indices\": [0, 80, 168, 264],    \"strengths\": [1.0, 0.8, 0.8, 0.85],    \"anchor_strategy\": \"segment_start\"  },  \"negative_prompt\": \"worst quality, inconsistent motion, blurry, jittery, distorted face, deformed face, ugly, aged skin, wrinkles, asymmetric eyes, extra fingers, mutated hands, bad anatomy, static image, frozen, oversaturated, plastic skin, motion smear, transition cuts, scene change, text overlay, watermark, multiple girls, character duplication, ghost double, split screen, lighting change mid-shot, mouth opening wide, mouth open shouting, speaking animatedly, exaggerated mouth movement, lip flap, picture-in-picture, frame within frame, embedded image, image inside image, double exposure overlay, hard cut, jump cut, smash cut, montage style, scene transition wipe, fade to black, crossfade, multiple panels, comic panel layout, photo collage\"}",
